# Security audit output — NEVER commit, this repo is public.
# Contains the WAN IP, the full internal topology, open ports per segment and
# findings that are not remediated yet (C1: iDRAC on the flat L2 with an
# OpenSSH vulnerable to Terrapin; C2: OPT1 -> LAN segmentation that does not
# actually block). In a public repo that is a map, not documentation. Keep it
# local or in a private repo until the criticals are closed.
